{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist awakens in complete darkness, with no memory of how they got there.<br>A faint light in the distance is their only clue. As they follow it, they find something that shouldn't exist in this place\u2014a toy from their childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>first-person psychological horror adventure</strong> themed around memory and the mind.<br>As the player wanders through the pitch-black void, they encounter fragmented memories and eerie phenomena, slowly uncovering why they are here\u2014and what they must do next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story branches based on your choices, leading to multiple possible endings.<br>Experience a chilling journey through silence, shadows, and self-reflection.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u6700\u521d\u306e\u9078\u629e / The First Choice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853350/26ceee11f3ba1f1b464f5440463df9f6fbb61b5f.jpg"},{"name":"\u5927\u5207\u306a\u4eba\u3068\u306e\u672a\u6765 / A Future with a Loved One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853350/45069870dbc0fa789015cb8eeeb88916068c6cdf.jpg"},{"name":"\u5929\u56fd\u3078\u306e\u8a98\u3044 / A Call to Heaven\\","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853350/399712a93326057e3fd457444f5db9e5e90ac752.jpg"},{"name":"\u5730\u7344\u306e\u5e95 / Descent into Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3853350/6c48a43bdaa454654e2a5883df2a34e00104ca91.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853350?t=1754578860","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853350/9d42a62ef45a917b2d54310cee0c366570d55069/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754578860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/385335